      "bbox": {
        "l": 198.12900000000008,
        "t": 181.01991953125003,
        "r": 339.4200000000001,
        "b": 134.7722344167462
      },
      "content": "Ensure the tabs are not bent during this process. Secure them by laying them upon a piece of tube while pushing out the studs.",
